## Required Access

The machine or automation runner must have access to both accounts.

### Source Account Minimum Access

The source profile only needs read access.

Recommended minimum permissions:

```text
ec2:DescribeSecurityGroups
ec2:DescribeVpcs
ec2:DescribeTags
```

### Target Account Required Access

The target profile needs read/write access for security group reconciliation.

Recommended permissions:

```text
ec2:DescribeSecurityGroups
ec2:DescribeVpcs
ec2:CreateSecurityGroup
ec2:AuthorizeSecurityGroupIngress
ec2:AuthorizeSecurityGroupEgress
ec2:CreateTags
```

If future strict cleanup is enabled, revoke permissions would also be required, but the current source-required-only policy does not actively remove extra target rules.

